DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuccyyccoomm driver supports usb(4) serial devices based on Cypress micro‐
     controllers.  The following adapters are supported:

           Various low-cost USB-RS232 adapters
           DeLorme Earthmate GPS receiver

     The driver acts as a bridge between uhidev(4) and the ucom(4) driver
     which makes it behave like a tty(4).

